{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "00a20999-25d8-8572-a452-14567af64c79",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T12:25:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi Owen. I'm calling about a construction crew, you know, they keep starting work before seven in the morning. Can you hear me okay? I'm on speaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Before seven, you said. Where is this happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's next door to me, 48 Howard Street. Well, I'm at 48, the work is right beside us. In the Fifth Ward, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 48 Howard Street. And how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday. So that's yesterday and again today. I mean, yesterday I figured, okay, one day. Then this morning, same thing, saws and a truck backing up, beeping, at like six-fifteen. You know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six-fifteen. That's early, I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:23:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So what are the quiet hours? Like, when are they actually allowed to start? Because nobody seems to know that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally the city has set hours for construction noise in the morning and evening. I don't have the exact times in front of me, so I'd rather have the right office confirm them. I can send you to the inspections office, or take your information and have someone reach out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] Sorry, you said call back? I'm supposed to call back later? I mean, I've been, I'm at work on my lunch, I can't just keep calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I said I can take your information and have them call you. You wouldn't need to call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. Sorry, the speaker's bad. Right, so you call me. Okay, that's better, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Can I have a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven six. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Teresa Resendes. R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Teresa. I'll note it's a construction crew starting before seven at 48 Howard Street since Monday, and that you're asking for the quiet hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:25:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And that it's every morning. I mean, I just want it to stop being so early, you know? It's wicked early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll pass that along today. Someone should call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:25:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Owen. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T12:25:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
